<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Sejarah | Diakronik & Sinkronik</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --primary:#123a6d;
      --primary-dark:#0e2a4d;
      --secondary:#f3b63f;
      --soft:#edf4ff;
      --light:#ffffff;
      --text:#1f2937;
      --muted:#64748b;
      --success:#22c55e;
      --danger:#ef4444;
      --shadow:0 15px 35px rgba(17,24,39,.08);
      --radius:20px;
    }

    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
    body{
      margin:0;
      font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f8fbff 0%,#eef4fd 100%);
      color:var(--text);
      line-height:1.7;
    }

    a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
    img{max-width:100%}

    .container{
      width:min(1200px, calc(100% - 32px));
      margin:0 auto;
    }

    header{
      position:sticky;
      top:0;
      z-index:1000;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);
      backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
      border-bottom:1px solid rgba(18,58,109,.08);
    }

    .nav{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:space-between;
      min-height:72px;
      gap:20px;
    }

    .brand{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:12px;
      font-weight:800;
      color:var(--primary);
      letter-spacing:.02em;
    }

    .brand-mark{
      width:42px;
      height:42px;
      border-radius:12px;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), #2f6ed5);
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      color:white;
      font-size:22px;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    }

    .nav-links{
      display:flex;
      gap:18px;
      align-items:center;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
    }

    .nav-links a{
      color:var(--text);
      font-weight:600;
      opacity:.85;
      transition:.2s ease;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover{opacity:1;color:var(--primary)}
    .btn{
      display:inline-flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      border:none;
      border-radius:999px;
      padding:14px 22px;
      font-weight:700;
      cursor:pointer;
      transition:.2s ease;
      box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(18,58,109,.18);
    }
    .btn-primary{
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), #2b5ca8);
      color:white;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover{transform:translateY(-1px)}
    .btn-secondary{
      background:white;
      color:var(--primary);
      border:1px solid rgba(18,58,109,.15);
    }

    .hero{
      padding:72px 0 36px;
      position:relative;
    }

    .hero-wrap{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;
      gap:36px;
      align-items:center;
    }

    .eyebrow{
      display:inline-flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:8px;
      padding:8px 14px;
      background:rgba(18,58,109,.08);
      border:1px solid rgba(18,58,109,.1);
      border-radius:999px;
      font-size:.8rem;
      font-weight:700;
      color:var(--primary);
      margin-bottom:18px;
    }

    h1{
      font-size:clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 4.2rem);
      line-height:1.12;
      margin:0 0 18px;
      color:var(--primary-dark);
    }

    .lead{
      font-size:1.07rem;
      color:var(--muted);
      max-width:620px;
      margin-bottom:28px;
    }

    .cta-row{
      display:flex;
      gap:14px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      margin-bottom:22px;
    }

    .stats{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(120px,1fr));
      gap:18px;
      max-width:560px;
    }

    .stat{
      background:white;
      border:1px solid rgba(18,58,109,.08);
      border-radius:16px;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      padding:18px 16px;
    }

    .stat strong{
      display:block;
      font-size:1.5rem;
      color:var(--primary);
    }
    .stat span{
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:.92rem;
    }

    .hero-card{
      background:linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #eef6ff 100%);
      border-radius:30px;
      border:1px solid rgba(18,58,109,.08);
      box-shadow:0 28px 55px rgba(18,58,109,.12);
      overflow:hidden;
    }

    .mini-header{
      padding:18px 22px;
      display:flex;
      justify-content:space-between;
      align-items:center;
      background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0e2a4d,#123a6d);
      color:white;
      font-weight:700;
    }

    .mini-body{
      padding:22px;
    }

    .teacher-badge{
      display:inline-block;
      background:rgba(243,182,63,.15);
      color:#9b6600;
      border:1px solid rgba(243,182,63,.2);
      border-radius:999px;
      font-size:.8rem;
      font-weight:700;
      padding:7px 12px;
      margin-bottom:18px;
    }

    .teacher-card{
      padding:18px;
      border-radius:18px;
      background:white;
      border:1px solid rgba(18,58,109,.08);
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    }

    .teacher-card .row{
      display:flex;
      gap:12px;
      align-items:center;
      margin-bottom:14px;
    }

    .avatar{
      width:62px;
      height:62px;
      border-radius:50%;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f3b63f,#ffdf97);
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      font-weight:900;
      color:#3b2d00;
      box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 3px rgba(255,255,255,.5);
    }

    .teacher-name{
      font-weight:800;
      color:var(--primary-dark);
      margin:0 0 2px;
      font-size:1.1rem;
    }

    .teacher-role{
      margin:0;
      font-size:.82rem;
      color:var(--muted);
    }

    .quote{
      margin:16px 0 0;
      padding:14px 16px;
      border-left:4px solid var(--secondary);
      background:#fffaf0;
      border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;
      color:#7c5b18;
      font-style:italic;
    }

    section{
      padding:34px 0;
    }

    .section-head{
      margin-bottom:26px;
    }

    .section-head small{
      display:block;
      text-transform:uppercase;
      letter-spacing:.12em;
      font-weight:800;
      color:#5d7fb6;
      margin-bottom:8px;
    }

    h2{
      margin:0;
      font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.7rem);
      color:var(--primary-dark);
    }

    .about-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
      gap:26px;
    }

    .card{
      background:white;
      border-radius:20px;
      padding:24px;
      border:1px solid rgba(18,58,109,.08);
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    }

    .card h3{
      margin-top:0;
      color:var(--primary-dark);
      font-size:1.28rem;
    }

    ul.checklist{
      list-style:none;
      padding:0;
      margin:18px 0 0;
    }

    ul.checklist li{
      position:relative;
      padding-left:28px;
      margin-bottom:12px;
      color:var(--text);
      font-weight:600;
    }

    ul.checklist li::before{
      content:"✓";
      position:absolute;
      left:0;
      top:0;
      width:18px;
      height:18px;
      border-radius:50%;
      background:rgba(34,197,94,.1);
      color:var(--success);
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      font-weight:900;
      font-size:.8rem;
    }

    .cp-tp{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
      gap:26px;
    }

    .badge-box{
      display:inline-flex;
      border-radius:999px;
      padding:7px 12px;
      background:rgba(18,58,109,.08);
      color:var(--primary);
      font-weight:700;
      font-size:.82rem;
      margin-bottom:12px;
    }

    .objective-list{
      list-style:none;
      padding:0;
      margin:12px 0 0;
    }
    .objective-list li{
      margin-bottom:10px;
      padding-left:24px;
      position:relative;
      color:var(--text);
      font-weight:600;
    }
    .objective-list li::before{
      content:"→";
      position:absolute;
      left:0;
      color:var(--primary);
      font-weight:900;
    }

    .concept-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
      gap:26px;
    }

    .concept-box{
      background:linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f6f9ff 100%);
      border-radius:20px;
      border:1px solid rgba(18,58,109,.08);
      padding:24px;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    }

    .concept-tag{
      display:inline-block;
      background:rgba(18,58,109,.08);
      color:var(--primary);
      padding:7px 12px;
      border-radius:999px;
      font-size:.75rem;
      font-weight:800;
      letter-spacing:.06em;
      text-transform:uppercase;
      margin-bottom:12px;
    }

    .concept-box h3{
      margin:0 0 12px;
      color:var(--primary-dark);
      font-size:1.35rem;
    }

    .comparison-table{
      width:100%;
      border-collapse:collapse;
      margin-top:18px;
      border-radius:18px;
      overflow:hidden;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      background:white;
    }

    .comparison-table th,
    .comparison-table td{
      padding:16px 18px;
      border:1px solid rgba(18,58,109,.1);
      text-align:left;
      vertical-align:top;
    }

    .comparison-table thead th{
      background:linear-gradient(90deg,#123a6d,#214d8d);
      color:white;
      font-size:.96rem;
    }

    .comparison-table tbody tr:nth-child(odd){
      background:#fafcff;
    }

    .video-list{
      list-style:none;
      padding:0;
      margin:18px 0 0;
      display:grid;
      gap:16px;
    }

    .video-list li{
      background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f8fbff,#eef4fd);
      border:1px solid rgba(18,58,109,.08);
      border-radius:16px;
      padding:16px 18px;
    }

    .video-list strong{
      color:var(--primary-dark);
      display:block;
      margin-bottom:5px;
    }

    .map-concept{
      background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff,#f7fbff);
      border-radius:20px;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      border:1px solid rgba(18,58,109,.08);
      padding:22px;
      margin-top:20px;
    }

    .tree{
      list-style:none;
      margin:0;
      padding:0;
      line-height:1.9;
      color:var(--text);
      font-weight:600;
    }

    .tree ul{
      list-style:none;
      margin-left:18px;
      padding-left:18px;
      border-left:2px solid rgba(18,58,109,.12);
    }

    .tree li::before{
      content:"";
      display:inline-block;
      width:10px;
      height:10px;
      margin-right:10px;
      border-radius:50%;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), #5f89d7);
      vertical-align:middle;
    }

    .two-col{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
      gap:26px;
    }

    .feature-list{
      list-style:none;
      padding:0;
      margin:16px 0 0;
    }
    .feature-list li{
      display:flex;
      gap:10px;
      align-items:flex-start;
      margin-bottom:12px;
      color:var(--text);
    }

    .feature-list li .dot{
      width:12px;
      height:12px;
      border-radius:50%;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--secondary),#ffd36d);
      margin-top:8px;
      flex-shrink:0;
    }

    .quiz-box{
      background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff,#f3f8ff);
      border:1px solid rgba(18,58,109,.08);
      border-radius:18px;
      padding:22px;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    }

    .quiz-item{
      border:1px solid rgba(18,58,109,.08);
      border-radius:14px;
      padding:16px 18px;
      background:white;
      margin-bottom:16px;
    }

    .quiz-question{
      font-weight:700;
      color:var(--primary-dark);
      margin-bottom:12px;
    }

    .options{
      display:grid;
      gap:8px;
      margin-top:12px;
    }

    .option{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:10px;
      background:#f8fbff;
      border:1px solid rgba(18,58,109,.08);
      border-radius:10px;
      padding:10px 12px;
      cursor:pointer;
      transition:.15s ease;
    }

    .option:hover{
      border-color:rgba(18,58,109,.2);
      background:#f1f7ff;
    }

    .option input{accent-color:var(--primary)}
    .answer{
      display:none;
      margin-top:12px;
      border-left:4px solid var(--success);
      background:rgba(34,197,94,.06);
      color:#166534;
      padding:10px 12px;
      border-radius:8px;
      font-weight:700;
    }

    .leaderboard{
      display:grid;
      gap:12px;
      margin-top:20px;
    }

    .leader-row{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:50px 1fr 120px;
      align-items:center;
      gap:12px;
      background:white;
      border:1px solid rgba(18,58,109,.08);
      border-radius:12px;
      padding:12px 14px;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    }

    .rank{
      width:34px;
      height:34px;
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      border-radius:50%;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),#4c86d9);
      color:white;
      font-weight:800;
    }

    .leader-row:nth-child(1) .rank{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f7c948,#f0a500)}
    .leader-row:nth-child(2) .rank{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c1c6d4,#8c97b1)}
    .leader-row:nth-child(3) .rank{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d5a57b,#b7774a)}

    .name{
      font-weight:800;
      color:var(--primary-dark);
    }

    .score{
      justify-self:end;
      background:rgba(18,58,109,.06);
      color:var(--primary);
      padding:8px 12px;
      border-radius:999px;
      font-weight:800;
    }

    .chatbot{
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f2f56,#1c4d82);
      color:white;
      border-radius:22px;
      overflow:hidden;
      box-shadow:0 25px 60px rgba(12,32,56,.18);
    }

    .chat-header{
      padding:18px 20px;
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:space-between;
      border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);
    }

    .chat-bot{
      display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center; font-weight:700;
    }
    .bot-icon{
      width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%;
      display:grid; place-items:center;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f3b63f,#ffd66d); color:#3c2c00; font-weight:900;
    }

    .chat-status{
      font-size:.8rem; opacity:.85; font-weight:600;
    }

    .chat-body{
      padding:20px;
      display:grid;
      gap:12px;
      min-height:230px;
    }

    .msg{
      max-width:78%;
      padding:12px 14px;
      border-radius:16px;
      font-size:.96rem;
      line-height:1.5;
    }
    .msg.user{
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);
      color:#edf5ff;
      justify-self:end;
      border-bottom-right-radius:6px;
    }
    .msg.bot{
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      color:#edf5ff;
      justify-self:start;
      border-bottom-left-radius:6px;
    }

    .quick-questions{
      display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; margin-top:10px;
    }

    .pill{
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);
      color:white;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);
      border-radius:999px;
      padding:7px 12px;
      font-size:.8rem;
      font-weight:600;
      cursor:pointer;
    }

    .user-role{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
      gap:26px;
      margin-top:14px;
    }

    .role-panel{
      background:white; border:1px solid rgba(18,58,109,.08);
      border-radius:20px; padding:22px; box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    }

    .role-panel h3{
      margin-top:0;
      color:var(--primary-dark);
    }

    .role-panel ul{
      list-style:none;
      padding:0; margin:12px 0 0;
    }
    .role-panel li{
      position:relative;
      padding-left:24px;
      margin-bottom:10px;
      color:var(--text);
      font-weight:600;
    }
    .role-panel li::before{
      content:"•";
      position:absolute;
      left:0;
      color:var(--primary);
      font-size:1.5rem;
      top:-4px;
    }

    footer{
      padding:40px 0 60px;
      text-align:center;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-weight:600;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px){
      .hero-wrap, .about-grid, .concept-grid, .cp-tp, .two-col, .user-role{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
      }
      .nav{
        padding:12px 0;
        align-items:flex-start;
        flex-direction:column;
      }
      .stats{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
      }
      .nav-links{
        gap:10px 14px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 520px){
      .btn{width:100%}
      .cta-row{flex-direction:column}
      .leader-row{
        grid-template-columns:40px 1fr auto;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="container nav">
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="brand-mark">H</div>
        <span>Sejarah Digital</span>
      </div>

      <nav class="nav-links">
        <a href="#profil">Profil</a>
        <a href="#tujuan">Tujuan</a>
        <a href="#materi">Materi</a>
        <a href="#presensi">Presensi</a>
        <a href="#diskusi">Diskusi</a>
        <a href="#evaluasi">Evaluasi</a>
        <a href="#ai">AI Tutor</a>
      </nav>

      <button class="btn btn-primary">Masuk LMS</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-wrap">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">📚 Mata Pelajaran Sejarah | Kelas X</div>
          <h1>Perbedaan Berpikir <br>Diakronik dan Sinkronik</h1>
          <p class="lead">
            Mempelajari sejarah bukan sekadar menghafal tanggal, tetapi memahami proses, perubahan, ruang, dan kondisi peristiwa. Di sini siswa akan belajar bagaimana membedakan cara berpikir sejarah secara kronologis dan menyeluruh.
          </p>

          <div class="cta-row">
            <a href="#materi" class="btn btn-primary">Mulai Belajar</a>
            <a href="#evaluasi" class="btn btn-secondary">Lihat Kuis</a>
          </div>

          <div class="stats">
            <div class="stat">
              <strong>2</strong>
              <span>Pendekatan Utama</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
              <strong>7</strong>
              <span>Bagian Pembelajaran</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
              <strong>24/7</strong>
              <span>AI Tutor</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-card">
          <div class="mini-header">
            <span>Profil Guru</span>
            <span>Sejarah</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mini-body">
            <div class="teacher-badge">Guru Berpengalaman</div>

            <div class="teacher-card">
              <div class="row">
                <div class="avatar">GS</div>
                <div>
                  <p class="teacher-name">Guru Sejarah</p>
                  <p class="teacher-role">Pengajar • Mentor • Inspirator</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <p style="margin:0; color:var(--muted);">
                Sejarah bukan hanya masa lalu, tetapi jendela untuk memahami diri, bangsa, dan masa depan.
              </p>

              <div class="quote">
                “Belajar sejarah bukan sekadar mengingat peristiwa, tetapi melatih kita untuk berpikir, menilai, dan mengambil pelajaran dari perjalanan manusia.”
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="profil">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <small>Profil Guru</small>
          <h2>Guru sejarah yang profesional, ramah, dan inspiratif</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="about-grid">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Komitmen pembelajaran</h3>
            <p style="color:var(--muted); margin-top:10px;">
              Saya berkomitmen menciptakan pengalaman belajar sejarah yang aktif, berpihak pada siswa, dan menumbuhkan rasa ingin tahu. Setiap materi disampaikan dengan pendekatan yang sederhana, kontekstual, dan relevan dengan kehidupan sehari-hari.
            </p>

            <ul class="checklist">
              <li>Menjadikan sejarah sebagai bahan refleksi dan inspirasi.</li>
              <li>Mendorong siswa berpikir kritis dan analitis.</li>
              <li>Membantu siswa menyusun argumen berdasarkan bukti sejarah.</li>
              <li>Memberikan ruang diskusi yang aman, kreatif, dan menyenangkan.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Nilai utama pembelajaran</h3>
            <p style="color:var(--muted); margin-top:10px;">
              Dalam pembelajaran sejarah, siswa tidak hanya diminta mengingat, tetapi juga memahami makna dan menilai kejadian masa lalu. Dengan pendekatan yang tepat, sejarah dapat menjadi sumber pembelajaran yang hidup dan bermakna.
            </p>

            <ul class="checklist">
              <li>Rasa ingin tahu sebagai fondasi belajar.</li>
              <li>Kejujuran dalam menilai peristiwa sejarah.</li>
              <li>Semangat berkolaborasi dalam diskusi.</li>
